<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "800" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\桜とマンション.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others had invited me out; I turned them down and lay on the futon in my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't really know how much time had passed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was the hour when the orange evening sun dyes the room.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what were they doing now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They must surely be making the most of the Cherry Blossom Festival at Chuo Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But for me, going to the Cherry Blossom Festival is suicide.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The feeling of admiring cherry blossoms is something I cannot understand at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I let out a big sigh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want to deny the feeling of admiring cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I know it's just me who is strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There aren't many people at all who sink into a gloomy mood at this time of year.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the open window, along with the breeze, I could hear the din outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No sound in particular caught my attention.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now and then a child's voice, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of a car, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of the wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "1000"}
{STOPSND "BGM2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The intercom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting up was too much trouble. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about pretending not to be home, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But in this season, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I can pretty much guess who comes at this hour.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">All right, all right, I'm opening it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I opened the door, a high-school girl with short hair was standing there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought: </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{PLAYSND "アサガオと始まり.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "800" "100"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "1000"}
"Hey!
{PAUSE ""}
　How're you doing?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> gave her usual cheerful greeting.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so-so, I guess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I answered with something like a forced smile.</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"So the April sickness isn't any better this year either, huh." [TN: coined against the real Japanese term for a slump after a new start, the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> kept her smile, but twisted her mouth a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it happens every year, so I'm used to it by now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see...
{PAUSE ""}
Over on our side, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> ate her way through one stall after another and it was rough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even as she said it was rough, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> spoke happily.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is small and still a big eater, isn't she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Where does all that food go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">At last I managed to answer with a natural smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, I did get to nibble a bit myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, here. A souvenir!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "春花" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">I was handed a plastic bag, neither large nor small.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the feel of it in my hand, it was quite heavy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's takoyaki. Eat it while it's hot.
{PAUSE ""}
See ya!"
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
