{CHANGECG "古郡玄関" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\靴足音.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">Not long after the door closed, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I heard the door of the next apartment opening and closing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> went home oddly quickly, but</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it was probably because she was worried about the strain on my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> take all this trouble over me</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">has become my routine work every year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> doesn't mind, I know that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, I still feel bad about it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I let out another big sigh, picked up the plastic bag and went back to my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "古郡玄関" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\small_window_C.ogg" "SE2" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">It had gotten a little cold, so I closed the window.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The din outside vanished, and the room was wrapped in silence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "SE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "1000"}
<STYLE ID="1">I put the takoyaki on the desk and burrowed into the futon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sure enough, my </STYLE>best friend<STYLE ID="1"> knows me well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Last year she came by the same way too, didn't she?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But it's the first time she has brought a gift along.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She's always looking after me, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and I've never really done anything you could call thanks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The day before yesterday </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to have an upset stomach, so</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">next time </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> isn't well, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll take a gift along and go and see her.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> calls this gloomy mood of mine April sickness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this season when the cherry blossoms bloom, I sink into a gloom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The reason, I don't know...</STYLE><PG>
